{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636015415704813569","content":"@everyone At about 10:30am PST \nCroquet Death Match\n\n\nYour ball’s AC is equal to your opponents AC.\n\nThe rules. \nThere are 3 rounds.\nOn your first turn, you attempt to hit the ball through one of two wickets. \nEither the treasure wicket for 200 gold.\nOr the Monster wicket. A ball put through the monster wicket will proc a role on the wild magic table and steal half of your opponent’s accumulated stash. \nMissing the wicket means that if your opponent sinks their next shot your ball was hit and you have disadvantage on the next round.\nThe winner moves on to the next bracket and the loser is done. Only the champion keeps the pot. \n\n100 gold entry fee.","created_at":"2020-07-20T16:31:27.613000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-20T16:31:51.778000Z","id":"734809712704356433","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
